+# Changelog
+
+## 1.1.0-rc.1 - 2026-10-12
+
+Added a standalone governance core, policy/evidence validation, immutable proposal digests, separate review, durable jobs/receipts, atomic file storage, bounded Ollama tool loop and explicit keyword baseline. Added EN/DE console, tests, labelled evaluation, safe additive installer, OpenAPI and a reference Spring/PostgreSQL/Kafka/Camunda overlay.
+
+Added English/German architecture, API, operations, security, evaluation, release and demo documentation, release PDFs and LinkedIn drafts. Included test evidence and a verification matrix rather than fabricated model, browser-native, integration or production claims.
+
+No existing source files from the attachment were modified or deleted. The requested host repository was not cloned/merged; the overlay remains an owner-applied release gate.
